00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:12.020
I am Tanarot.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.810
This name is an oath.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.370
An oath?

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:19.700
As long as I have this name, I will continue being your servant.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:24.840
I will be beside Takuto from now on and consider it the best happiness to follow him.

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:26.430
Huh!?

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:39.230
By giving it a name, he bound part of the existence and defined its characteristics.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:43.280
It seems like a contract of master and servant has been made

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.500
between the summoner Takuto and the summoned girl.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.960
Takuto! I 'm happy!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:52.080
Ehhh!? Hey wait, you-

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.660
Not just "you"!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:54.870
I'm Tanarot.

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.380
Umm, well... Yeah...

00:21:58.380 --> 00:21:59.420
But, this is like...

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.420
A marriage vow!

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:10.130
There's no problem if he realizes it.

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:13.500
We can't simply let a dangerous girl roam around.

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:18.410
Takuto, you shall take responsibility for her.

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:21.150
Huh? That means...?

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.570
Takuto, Takuto!

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:26.990
What are you doing there?

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:29.130
We're going to play together!

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:32.120
This...

00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:35.970
If you're tired of playing, then let's go to sleep now.

00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:37.490
This is the wedding night!

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:39.330
Ah! Where'd you learn that word!

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:43.710
Do you think it's bad for me to touch you?

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:46.050
N-No, but that's...

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:48.220
Then we have no problem!

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:50.460
Hey, Tanarot!

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:00.270
Suzuho...

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:11.870
<b>If Tanarot is living here,
I'll also live at Taku-chan's house.</b>

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:12.620
Huh?!

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:16.360
Please look after me
from now on... okay?

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:22.810
Huh?!

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:43.330
The water droplets bounced
mizutama no shizuku ga hanete

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:46.740
a sky colored rythem glitters.
sorairo no rizumu kirari

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:49.920
Follow the tri-colored cat
fukafuka mikeneko ni tsuzuke

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:52.890
going on a walk.
sanpo ni deyou

