Yes, the direction of the fish's tears
sousa sakana no namida no yukue mo

00:23:57.210 --> 00:24:00.550
the rainbow connecting the sky and the city
sora to machi wo tsunagu niji mo

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:03.590
This world overfilling with questions,
nazonazo ni afureru sekai wo

